# Copy to secret-sentinels.txt (gitignored) and list any string that must NEVER appear in
# a release bundle — your broker host, VPN domain, camera host, MQTT username/password, etc.
#
# build-release.sh greps the .aab for these (case-insensitive, fixed strings) and refuses
# to publish if any match. This is the docs/11 §1 "strings on the APK" check, kept local so
# no real secret is committed to a public repo. One string per line; # starts a comment.
#
# Nothing should be compiled in (all config is on-device), so a correct build matches none
# of these — a hit means a deployment value leaked back into the binary.

# broker.example.lan
# mqtt-user
# vpn.example.com
# cctv.example.lan
